<emph>
B1009-95: Passenger Cut Off SW Detected
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
SDM for vehicle specification without passenger air bag deactivation switch is installed on vehicle with passenger air bag deactivation switch.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
SDM
</ptxt>
</entry>
