</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
When SDM not applicable to passenger air bag deactivation switch is installed in the vehicle with passenger air bag deactivation switch, this DTC is set. Replace with the correct SDM.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
